norm gdpr art 4 7 controller is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_GDPR_Art4_7_Controller".

norm gdpr art 4 7 controller is a definition.

norm gdpr art 4 7 controller has the label "GDPR Article 4(7): Definition of Controller".

norm gdpr art 4 7 controller has the definiendum "controller".

norm gdpr art 4 7 controller has the definiens "the natural or legal person, public authority, agency or any other body which, alone or jointly with others, determines the purposes and means of the processing of personal data".

norm gdpr art 4 7 controller is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/art_4/par_7".

norm gdpr art 4 7 controller specifies norm gdpr art 5 principles.


norm gdpr art 5 principles is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_GDPR_Art5_Principles".

norm gdpr art 5 principles is a constitutive rule.

norm gdpr art 5 principles has the label "GDPR Article 5: Principles relating to processing of personal data".

norm gdpr art 5 principles is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/art_5".


norm dir 2013 34 art 2 3 small undertakings is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_Dir2013_34_Art2_3_SmallUndertakings".

norm dir 2013 34 art 2 3 small undertakings is a definition.

norm dir 2013 34 art 2 3 small undertakings has the label "Directive 2013/34/EU Article 2(3): Definition of small undertakings".

norm dir 2013 34 art 2 3 small undertakings has the definiendum "small undertakings".

norm dir 2013 34 art 2 3 small undertakings has the definiens "undertakings which on their balance sheet dates do not exceed the limits of at least two of the three following criteria: (1) total assets: EUR 4,000,000; (2) net turnover: EUR 8,000,000; (3) average number of employees during the financial year: 50".

norm dir 2013 34 art 2 3 small undertakings is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_2/par_3".

norm dir 2013 34 art 2 3 small undertakings specifies norm dir 2013 34 art 4 reporting obligations.


norm dir 2013 34 art 4 reporting obligations is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_Dir2013_34_Art4_ReportingObligations".

norm dir 2013 34 art 4 reporting obligations is a prescriptive rule.

norm dir 2013 34 art 4 reporting obligations has the label "Directive 2013/34/EU Article 4: General requirements".

norm dir 2013 34 art 4 reporting obligations is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_4".


norm org farm art 3 general obligation is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_OrgFarm_Art3_GeneralObligation".

norm org farm art 3 general obligation is a prescriptive rule.

norm org farm art 3 general obligation has the label "Regulation (EU) 2018/848 Article 3: General Obligation".

norm org farm art 3 general obligation has the modality obligation.

norm org farm art 3 general obligation has the legal text "Operators producing, preparing or distributing organic products shall ensure and maintain the measures necessary to comply with this Regulation.".

norm org farm art 3 general obligation is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2018/848/art_3".


norm org farm art 10 crop production is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_OrgFarm_Art10_CropProduction".

norm org farm art 10 crop production is a substantive rule.

norm org farm art 10 crop production has the label "Regulation (EU) 2018/848 Article 10: Crop Production Requirements".

norm org farm art 10 crop production has the modality obligation.

norm org farm art 10 crop production specifies norm org farm art 3 general obligation.

norm org farm art 10 crop production has the legal text "For crop production, operators shall use crop and soil management practices adapted to local conditions, including where appropriate conservation of natural resources and maintenance or improvement of soil fertility, through [...] appropriate crop rotations; [...]".

norm org farm art 10 crop production is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2018/848/art_10".

norm org farm art 10 crop production has the comment "Article 10 specifies the general obligation in Article 3 by establishing concrete practices required for organic crop production".


norm e idas art 4 27 e id is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_eIDAS_Art4_27_eID".

norm e idas art 4 27 e id is a definition.

norm e idas art 4 27 e id has the label "eIDAS Regulation Article 4(27): Definition of electronic identification".

norm e idas art 4 27 e id has the definiendum "electronic identification".

norm e idas art 4 27 e id has the definiens "the process of using identification data in electronic form which uniquely represents either a natural or legal person".

norm e idas art 4 27 e id is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/910/art_4/par_27".

norm e idas art 4 27 e id specifies norm e idas art 6 identity requirements.


norm e idas art 6 identity requirements is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_eIDAS_Art6_IdentityRequirements".

norm e idas art 6 identity requirements is a constitutive rule.

norm e idas art 6 identity requirements has the label "eIDAS Regulation Article 6: General requirements for electronic identification".

norm e idas art 6 identity requirements is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/910/art_6".


